    "A metric schema editor builds metric_schema (key, label, unit, ref ranges, critical: low/high for a number, values for a text metric such as Positive).",
    "Per test (MSDS AAC 1, 4-6): turnaround_minutes (routine) and emergency_turnaround_minutes (Urgent, STAT; empty: the hospital defaults), availability InHouse or SendOut with send_out_partner_id (GET /diagnostic-partners?services=Lab), available_24h for the basic tests, notifiable_disease for a test whose positive result is a priority disease.",
    "Exists for the service laboratory or outsourced_diagnostics (setup): show it as GET /establishment views.screens says for screen_id lab_admin (full; open_work: without its new work, with the banner \"No new ... from now on\"; records: history and corrections only; setup: only from Facility settings; hidden: in no menu), after login and again on establishment.changed. Never decide it from the profile's category."
  ],
